Add Beginner Units 1-14 lessons (82 new)

Grammar, vocabulary, reading and guided writing for the ten teaching weeks plus
mid-term and final revision: subject pronouns, verb to be, possessives,
Present Simple, there is/are, Past Simple, can, would like, some/any, Present
Continuous, going to; objects, jobs, rooms, clothes, transport and more; short
readings; and the two exam writing formats (table-to-paragraph and picture
description) with mock-test practice. 76 word-order drills.

All texts and exercises are original; the syllabus was used as a topic outline.

